                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Some games pack every space with intricate details and a purpose for every piece of geography.  Knytt Underground takes a different approach.  Where exploration is defined more by a simple sense of wonder for the view and stopping to smell the flowers on the journey.  Never before have I spent 10 hours just wandering.  Checking every corner and crevice for the simple joy of it.  Few games can do this and fewer well but Knytt is definitely one of those games.",
